<!--
    Overlay on Playnite Default/Media.xaml.
    Icon set: original artwork drawn for this theme, in the angular manner of the StarCraft II menus (straight strokes,
    45-degree chamfers, octagons and hexagons where other sets use circles); nothing is taken or traced from the game.
    24 grid, 1.5 wide strokes with miter joins and flat caps. art/icons.py holds the path data and writes icons/*.svg;
    each Geometry below is drawn as a stroke by IconTemplate (a 24 grid scaled to the host) in the inherited foreground.
    IconSmallTemplate draws the same geometries with a heavier stroke for 12 to 16px hosts (dropdown, submenu, check).

    Menu icons (main menu, game menu) are theme file paths: Playnite's MenuHelpers.GetIcon loads a string resource as an
    image through ThemeFile, so each key names a PNG under Images/Icons. Those are the same artwork rendered at 48px
    in the text-soft token (red-light for exit and remove, cyan for the filled favorite star) by art/render-png.mjs;
    icons.json lists the same jobs for scripts/render-icons.ps1 on Windows. Sidebar Library and Statistics get their
    icons through CustomControls/SidebarItem.xaml.
-->
<ResourceDictionary xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
                    xmlns:sys="clr-namespace:System;assembly=mscorlib">

